{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/news/secretary-of-state-for-northern-ireland-appointment-sir-chris-bryant-statement","content_id":"f2f29605-0365-47ae-8111-3f8d410d0439","description":"Sir Chris Bryant sets out his priorities as Secretary of State for Northern Ireland.","details":{"attachments":[],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p><strong> Speaking on his appointment as Secretary of State for Northern Ireland, Sir Chris Bryant, said:</strong></p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>I am really pleased to be the new Secretary of State for Northern Ireland. It’s certainly daunting. It comes with heavy responsibility, and I am looking forward to getting properly stuck in.</p>\n\n  <p>I want to be very clear from the outset: my door will be open to all parties and all communities. We are going to work together constructively to keep building a stable, prosperous future for everyone in Northern Ireland.</p>\n\n  <p>Our focus is simple: maintaining political stability, promoting economic growth, and making sure devolved government delivers for people in their everyday lives. </p>\n\n  <p class=\"last-child\">We need to make sure that every young person sees an economic opportunity for themselves in Northern Ireland, and for their family. There is serious work ahead, and I am ready to get on with it.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-07-21T16:41:08Z"}],"emphasised_organisations":["234148b2-66d6-457c-9d06-2bf2b98533ca"],"images":[{"caption":"Sir Chris Bryant, Secretary of State for Northern Ireland","content_type":"image/jpeg","sources":{"s216":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f140dd52549f5f96ca7/s216_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG","s300":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f1447af652afa0c89a1/s300_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG","s465":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f14b00f3323bf1a23b5/s465_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG","s630":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f140dd52549f5f96ca6/s630_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG","s712":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f14712f1615191a23b8/s712_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG","s960":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5f9f14f869f6a53d0c89af/s960_0O2A71520O2A7152.JPG"},"type":"lead"}],"political":true},"document_type":"press_release","first_published_at":"2026-07-21T17:41:08+01:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/news/secretary-of-state-for-northern-ireland-appointment-sir-chris-bryant-statement","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/news/secretary-of-state-for-northern-ireland-appointment-sir-chris-bryant-statement","base_path":"/government/news/secretary-of-state-for-northern-ireland-appointment-sir-chris-bryant-statement","content_id":"f2f29605-0365-47ae-8111-3f8d410d0439","document_type":"press_release","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-07-21T16:41:08Z","schema_name":"news_article","title":"Secretary of State for Northern Ireland appointment: Sir Chris Bryant statement","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/news/secretary-of-state-for-northern-ireland-appointment-sir-chris-bryant-statement","withdrawn":false}],"emphasised_organisations":[{"analytics_identifier":"D19","api_path":"/api/content/government/organisations/northern-ireland-office","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/organisations/northern-ireland-office","base_path":"/government/organisations/northern-ireland-office","content_id":"234148b2-66d6-457c-9d06-2bf2b98533ca","details":{"acronym":"NIO","brand":"northern-ireland-office","default_news_image":{"high_resolution_url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1c366f494ab2e7b725/s960_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6708fb1de84ae1fd8592f1ec/s300_NIO_Gov.uk_banner.png"},"logo":{"crest":"single-identity","formatted_title":"Northern<br/>Ireland<br/>Office"},"organisation_govuk_status":{"status":"live","upda